# Allow-list: send the Docker daemon only what the images use. data/ holds gigabytes of research inputs
# (elevation tiles, flood maps, OSM extracts) that no image needs.
*
!packages
!services/router_api
!server/app
!server/requirements.txt
!app
!config
!deploy
!data/packs
!data/places
!data/watchlist

